  "content": "<p>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kB3Rs9hRC\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lcKvuW.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>  \n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Javieljefe/posts/villagers-reborn-161251490\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FQUxwX9.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjavieljefe\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2o5H7aP.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>    \n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Javieljefe/Villagers-Reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iEov6p6.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p>你可以免费在此关注开发进度、开发日志和未来更新&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/collection/2146365?view=expanded\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a></strong>&nbsp;📝</p>\n<p>如果你希望支持该项目，可以在&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjavieljefe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ko-fi</strong></a>&nbsp;☕ 请我喝杯咖啡</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/157868171\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83QcmPt.png\" alt=\"Cover\"></a></p>\n<p><strong><h2>模组合集 ⚔️</h2></strong></p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villagers-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7DMzqFk.png\" alt=\"Villagers Reborn\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>  \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasy-knights-factions\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u4aFHD4.png\" alt=\"Fantasy Factions\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/survival-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x6COPTt.png\" alt=\"Survival Needs\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>    \n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-walk\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/r35zoWX.png\" alt=\"Immersive Walk\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>宝可梦属性表 (Cobblemon / Pixelmon)</strong></h1>\n<p>这是一个简单的模组，将宝可梦的属性克制图表添加到了 Minecraft 中。</p>\n<p>它&nbsp;<strong>可与&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></strong>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pixelmon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixelmon</a></strong>&nbsp;或其他任何模组配合使用！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 可以通过右键点击手中的物品来打开属性表。</p>\n<p>- 也可以使用默认按键 <strong>H</strong> 打开（可在“控制” - “键位绑定”中修改）。</p>\n<p>- 提供 8 种不同的颜色用于属性表。</p>\n<p>- 图标可以选择是否显示边框，可在游戏内的模组选项或直接配置文件中 (cobblemontypechart-common.toml) 切换。</p>\n<p>- 若要在游戏内直接更改设置，你需要安装 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></strong>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>此模组完全为客户端模组，适用于任何原版或整合包服务器</strong>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>属性表</strong></h2>\n<p>游戏内属性图表 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354015/description_a012d1f2-f206-44df-a179-85799d232d49.png\" alt=\"In-game type table\"></p>\n<h2><strong>工具提示</strong></h2>\n<p>将鼠标悬停在属性图标上即可查看其克制关系<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354015/description_c3b16dac-c41f-451e-8cb8-1154eb485ce8.png\" alt=\"A visual reference for the tooltips\"></p>\n<h2><strong>合成配方</strong></h2>\n<p>合成配方：2 张纸 + 1 个铁锭 + 染料（用于改变颜色）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354015/description_70bbba5b-d8d4-4922-9379-d416a70e76bb.png\" alt=\"The in-game recipe for the new item\"></p>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：如果你没有使用带有 <strong>Iris</strong>、<strong>OptiFine</strong> 或类似模组的<strong>光影</strong>，属性表可能会出现模糊。若要在不使用光影的情况下解决此问题，请进入“视频设置” - <strong>菜单背景模糊</strong>并将其设置为<strong>关闭</strong>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/villagers-reborn-159604973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kWexfa8.png\" alt=\"Cover\"></a></p>",
